DTEND:20261231T163000
UID:reminder-20261231-8a2afd32-1
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
X-MICROSOFT-CDO-BUSYSTATUS:FREE
DESCRIPTION:Hebcal joins you in remembering Golda\, whose 34th Yahrzeit oc
 curs on Friday\, January 1\, corresponding to the 22nd of Tevet\, 5787.\n\
 nGolda’s Yahrzeit begins at sundown on Thursday\, December 31 and contin
 ues until sundown on the day of observance. It is customary to light a mem
 orial candle at dusk as the Yahrzeit begins.\n\nMay your loved one’s sou
 l be bound up in the bond of eternal life and may their memory serve as a 
 continued source of inspiration and comfort to you.
